# 🛡️ Ethical Hacking Simulation Framework for Cybersecurity Education Using Generative AI

An AI-powered cybersecurity education platform developed to help students learn ethical hacking through interactive simulations, AI guidance, and practical cybersecurity tools.

---

# 📖 Project Overview

The **Ethical Hacking Simulation Framework** is an educational platform that combines Artificial Intelligence with cybersecurity tools to provide hands-on learning. It integrates **Google Gemini**, **Nmap**, and **Wireshark** into an interactive **Streamlit** dashboard, allowing users to generate attack scenarios, receive AI guidance, perform network scanning, and analyze packet captures.

This project is intended for students and beginners who want to understand ethical hacking concepts in a safe and controlled environment.

---

# ✨ Features

- 🤖 AI Mentor for Cybersecurity Guidance
- 🎯 AI-Powered Scenario Generator
- 🌐 Network Scanning using Nmap
- 📡 Packet Analysis using Wireshark
- 📋 Nmap Parsed Scan Results
- 📊 Usage Statistics Dashboard
- 📈 Reports Dashboard
- 🎓 Interactive Learning Platform

