# 🎯 Objectives

- Provide an AI-powered ethical hacking learning platform.
- Generate real-world cybersecurity attack scenarios.
- Teach network scanning using Nmap.
- Analyze captured packets using Wireshark.
- Improve cybersecurity knowledge through practical exercises.
- Create an interactive and beginner-friendly learning experience.

---

# 🔄 Workflow

1. Launch the Streamlit dashboard.
2. Generate an ethical hacking scenario using AI.
3. Interact with the AI Mentor for explanations and guidance.
4. Perform network scanning using Nmap.
5. View parsed scan results.
6. Analyze captured packets using Wireshark.
7. Review reports and usage statistics.

